<title>GERMANY: Siemens-Nixdorf loss carry-forward 2 bln DM.</title>
<headline>Siemens-Nixdorf loss carry-forward 2 bln DM.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siemens AG said the loss carry-forward at its Siemens-Nixdorf Informationssysteme AG computers unit was over two billion marks.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
